--- !u!114 &901281436352031295
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2905841799857425865}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 4e9445fd9bddcaf47b145e7d526aa5a2, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 30
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 3
    m_MaxSize: 30
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Fight your way through the Plains. Follow the path from the garden into
    the building, find your way through the maze and reach the door in the end room
    to get to the next floor. Mobs start spawning as you get close, so keep moving,
    keep your stats up and fight back.


    <b>Controls</b>

    - WASD - Move

    -
    Shift - Sprint (uses stamina)

    - Space - Jump

    - Mouse - Aim (the arrow
    on the floor shows where you''ll shoot)

    - Left Click / X - Attack with your
    selected weapon

    - 1 / 2 - Select Shooter / Melee

    - Q / E - Use your abilities (E opens doors when
    next to one)

    - R - Reload the shooter

    - 4-9, 0 - Eat or drink from
    that inventory slot

    - I - Open / close inventory

    - J - Open / close
    achievements

    - E / Click the prompt - Use a door

    - Right Click + drag
    - Rotate the camera

    - Scroll - Zoom in / out

    - H - Hide / show the
    UI

    - Esc - Menu


    <b>Mobs</b>

    - Level 1 and Level 2 mobs chase
    you and hit you when they''re close

    - Level 3 mobs stay still and shoot
    at you from a distance

    - Every mob shows its health bar above its head

    -
    Killed mobs can drop food and drinks, walk over them to pick them up

    - The
    tracker at the top shows how many mobs are left


    <b>Your Health</b>

    -
    Health, Stamina, Hunger and Thirst all go from 0 to 100 (bars at the bottom of
    the screen)

    - Hunger and thirst slowly go down. If either drops to 25 or
    below, you start losing health

    - Eat and drink (keys 4-9, 0) to stay alive

    -
    Sprinting uses stamina, it refills when you stop

    - If your health reaches
    0, the level restarts'
